      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The new social ui menu have things that makes good and poor thoughts.\n\n* First, the banners look like what people would set for a preview view. They make group banners need to change to fit again.\n\n* Second, the change from yellow names to white makes finding friends in big lobbys more difficult. However the yellow border with the addition of showing badges is a good thing, just change the name color to match the border.\n\nA thought that I think could be good.\n\n* If it's not to convoluted or difficult, the color change for friends names could have a menu option like what vrc+ gives.",
